	(descr "Hirose DF40GB(1.5)-30DS-0.4V(51), HRS CL0684-4198-4-51. 30-pos 0.4mm pitch shielded double-row RECEPTACLE, 1.5mm stack height. Mates with DF40GB-30DP-0.4V(51). Land pattern from DF40 catalog p.12 Recommended PCB Pattern <30 pos.>. PIN 1 IS AT +X: the footprint is mirrored in X relative to the plug because the boards mate face to face. G1-G4 are shield/retention tabs - tie to GND.")
